  <section id="section-1" class="pt-16">
    <h4>1. INTRODUCTION</h4>
    <p class="mb-4">Thank you for choosing to be part of our community at Figo. Figo is a Bangladeshi company, provides you web-hosting, domain name registration, and related products and service. Figo seeks to ensure the highest level of data privacy when offering its variety of quality products and services to Figo subscribers. When you use the Platform or any of our services, we appreciate that you are trusting us with your personal information.</p>
    <p class="mb-4">This Privacy Policy explains how Figo processes information to directly or indirectly identify an individual collected on our Site, services, forums, and mobile applications. Our privacy policy is part of our (any) contracts, incorporated with our other <a href="/legal">legal documents.</a>. We hope you take some time to read through it carefully, as it is important. <strong><i>If there are any terms in this privacy notice that you do not agree with, please discontinue use of our Platform or Services immediately.</i></strong></p>
    <p>We are committed to protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. If you have any questions or concerns about this privacy notice, or our practices with regards to your personal information, please contact us at <a href="mailto:legal@figo.host">legal@figo.host</a>.</p>
