      <li><strong>Tracking technologies and Cookies:</strong> We use cookies, tags, scripts and other similar technologies. We also automatically collect information about the device's operating system, device model, device ID and customer number. For more detailed information on the use of these technologies, see our <a href="#section-8">Cookies Policy (Section 8)</a>.</li>
