    <p class="mb-4">We use personal information collected via our Platform or Services for businesses and relational purposes to provide, understand, improve, and develop the Platform. We process your personal information for these purposes in reliance on our legitimate business interests to enter into or perform a contract with you, with your consent, and/or for compliance with our legal obligations. We indicate the specific processing grounds we rely on next to each purpose listed below.</p>
