    <p class="mb-4">If you are a resident in Switzerland, the contact details for the data protection authorities are available here: <a href="https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/edoeb/en/home.html">https://www.edoeb<wbr>.admin.ch<wbr>/edoeb/en<wbr>/home.html</a>.</p>
