    <p class="mb-8">When creating an Account at our Platform, you are free to opt-out from receiving various offers directly to your email, phone, or in your Figo account. We use provided contact details and your preferences for direct marketing by sending various offers or newsletters. These direct marketing offers, depending on your preferences, may be personalized using any other information, which you have provided to us (e.g. location, social media profile information, purchase history, etcetera) or we have collected or generated from other sources as described below.</p>
